<title>ROMANIA: Romanian retail sales fall 0.4 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Romanian retail sales fall 0.4 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Board reported the following economic indicator details:</p>
<p> ROMANIAN RETAIL SALES	JULY     JUNE    JULY 1995</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	     1,839.9  1,718.5    1,275.5</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	    -0.4     -5.5	-0.9</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +12.8     +9.4     +32.3</p>
<p> private sector pct share    77.9     80.0	70.6</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO JULY)</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	    11,666.8  9,826.9   8,001.7</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +18.0    +19.0     +27.7</p>
<p> private sector pct share    79.5     79.8	69.5</p>
<p>NOTES -- Year-on-year and month-per-month changes in comparable prices.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
